        "description": "Content is trimmed and accepts LF and tabs, with CRLF normalized to LF. Other text rejects control characters; all text must be nonblank and well-formed Unicode. Revisions append a full replacement with the same kind and current supersedes_id. Missing verification resets to unverified. owner_ref is only a label, never an identity."
